#. module: fieldservice_stock
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:fieldservice_stock.field_fsm_order__reference_ids
msgid ""
"Stock references (the grouping of transfers that replaced procurement "
"groups) this order is part of. Filled when the sale that created the order "
"is confirmed, so the order and its sale share the same transfers. Example: "
"sale S00042 -> reference S00042 -> the delivery of its tiles and the order "
"installing them."
msgstr ""

